          "text": "Dear Colleague,\n\nHistory of Present Illness:\nThe patient has focal epilepsy of structural etiology, with seizure onset at 8 years of age. Seizures are focal aware seizures and currently occur approximately three times per month. The epilepsy is drug-responsive.\n\nCurrent Medication:\n- Zonisamide, current antiseizure medication.\n\nSeizure Burden:\nApproximately three focal aware seizures per month.\n\nAssessment:\n1. Drug-responsive focal epilepsy with focal aware seizures.\n2. Structural etiology.\n3. MRI finding of focal cortical dysplasia.\n\nPlan:\n- Continue zonisamide.\n- Continue monitoring seizure frequency.\n\nSincerely,\nEpilepsy Clinic",
